The DRAM_test Modelsim project uses 4 files:

VLSI_TestBench_pkg.vhd
dram_ent.vhd
dram_sim_arch.vhd
dram_tb.vhd

You will probably have to remove these files from the project and re-add them since the path to them will be differnt than the path on my machine.

Add the 4 files, then order and compile them.
Start simulation on the dram_tb model

do run_dram_example

Should initialize the DRAM from dram_data.srec
Should create a log file named Log.txt
